   "worked_solution": [
      {
         "step": 1,
         "text": "Reversing the limits, \\( g(x) = -\\int_{5}^{2 x} \\sqrt{t^{3} + 1} \\, dt \\), so by the Fundamental Theorem of Calculus its derivative is minus the integrand evaluated at \\( 2 x \\).",
