               ]
            ]
         ]
      },
      {
         "step": 2,
         "text": "The chain rule multiplies by the derivative of \\( 2 x \\), which is \\( 2 \\).",
         "mathjson": 2
      },
      {
         "step": 3,
         "text": "At \\( x = 1 \\) the limit is \\( 2 \\) and its derivative is \\( 2 \\).",
         "mathjson": 2
      },
      {
         "step": 4,
         "text": "Using \\( f\\left(2\\right) = 3 \\), \\( g'\\left(1\\right) = -3 \\cdot 2 = -6 \\).",
